	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08r0601_trainerm_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンリーグへ　むかうには
とおく　セイガイハシティから▽
ぐるりと　まわりこまないとな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T06:48:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンリーグへ　向かうには
遠く　セイガイハシティから▽
ぐるりと　回りこまないとな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T06:48:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T06:48:52" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>TRAINERM</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
